<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY 47 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY 47 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>HYDERABAD, India 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat India</p>
<p>by 47 runs in the opening match of the Titan Cup triangular</p>
<p>one-day tournament on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 261-7 (50 overs), India 214 (46.3).</p>
</text>
